        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 7131-628 Economy Priced Aluminum 4 x 16 Pull Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size 4\" x 16\" commercial door pull plate with 8-3/8\" pull handle. Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories and stores. Made of .050\" thick aluminum. Brushed aluminum with clear anodizing finish. Packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-7131-628_size.gif?v=1704354609\" width=\"580\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 7131-628 Aluminum Pull Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/economy-priced-aluminum-4-x-16-push-plates-don-jo-71-628\"><b>4\" x 16\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nEconomy priced for budget conscious projects, yet high quality .050\" thick solid non-rusting aluminum with large sized 8-3/4\" handle.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Don-Jo 7131-628 Aluminum Pull Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Height: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Brushed Aluminum</b> with Clear Anodizing</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7131-628.pdf?v=1704262265\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 7131-628 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> Get a matching <a href=\"/products/economy-priced-aluminum-4-x-16-push-plates-don-jo-71-628\"><b>4\" x 16\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>",
